# METER Live Stack

## Layout

- `src/meter/http.ts` — `/api/v1/*` router (wired from `src/server.ts`)
- `src/meter/paystream.ts` — authorize prepaid or x402 settle
- `src/meter/research.ts` — paid `/research` via Tavily + TinyFish
- `src/meter/ledger.ts` — durable JSON ledger (`data/ledger.json`)
- `src/meter/invoice.ts` / `flovia.ts` — invoices + analytics from ledger only

## Rules

- Dashboard reads `GET /api/v1/ledger` — never reintroduce static demo arrays.
- Unpaid research must return **HTTP 402** + `PAYMENT-REQUIRED` (base64).
- Prepaid path headers: `X-Meter-Agent-Id`, `X-Meter-Payment: prepaid`.
- On-chain x402 requires `METER_PAY_TO` + `METER_USDC_ASSET`; otherwise fail that path with 501 — prepaid remains live.
- Workspace daily cap default **20 USDC** (Binance Agentic Wallet x402 default per TechCrunch 2026-08-20).
- Enforce zod/input validation; do not swallow provider errors.

## Example 402

```http
HTTP/1.1 402 Payment Required
PAYMENT-REQUIRED: <base64 PaymentRequired>
X-Meter-Price: 0.02
```
